WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.944
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emma. Welcome to Online B one, Book two.

2
00:00:05.244 --> 00:00:08.607
Hi! I'm Visal. Let's learn together!

3
00:00:08.907 --> 00:00:15.518
Unit eighteen: My Role Models. Today you will describe people you admire using relative clauses with who.

4
00:00:15.818 --> 00:00:18.506
Here is our lesson map. Let's start!

5
00:00:19.467 --> 00:00:22.758
Part one: words. You will learn eight new words.

6
00:00:23.617 --> 00:00:24.653
Role model.

7
00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.706
Role model means a person you admire and want to be like.

8
00:00:29.317 --> 00:00:31.363
My grandmother is my role model.

9
00:00:31.950 --> 00:00:34.509
Your turn. Say: Role model.

10
00:00:37.367 --> 00:00:38.472
Role model.

11
00:00:39.217 --> 00:00:40.334
Inspire.

12
00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:44.847
Inspire means to give someone the wish to do something good.

13
00:00:45.450 --> 00:00:47.798
Her story inspires me to work hard.

14
00:00:48.383 --> 00:00:51.396
Your turn. Say: Inspire.

15
00:00:54.233 --> 00:00:55.351
Inspire.

16
00:00:56.117 --> 00:00:57.036
Admire.

17
00:00:58.050 --> 00:01:01.129
Admire means to respect and like someone very much.

18
00:01:01.717 --> 00:01:03.774
I admire my teacher's patience.

19
00:01:04.383 --> 00:01:07.442
Your turn. Say: Admire.

20
00:01:10.300 --> 00:01:11.220
Admire.

21
00:01:11.983 --> 00:01:13.019
Achievement.

22
00:01:14.017 --> 00:01:16.539
Achievement means something good you did with effort.

23
00:01:17.150 --> 00:01:19.614
Building a school was her greatest achievement.

24
00:01:20.217 --> 00:01:22.625
Your turn. Say: Achievement.

25
00:01:25.467 --> 00:01:26.410
Achievement.

26
00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:28.267
Influence.

27
00:01:29.283 --> 00:01:32.688
Influence means to change how someone thinks or acts.

28
00:01:33.283 --> 00:01:35.747
Good friends influence you in a positive way.

29
00:01:36.350 --> 00:01:38.828
Your turn. Say: Influence.

30
00:01:41.667 --> 00:01:42.633
Influence.

31
00:01:43.383 --> 00:01:44.361
Example.

32
00:01:45.350 --> 00:01:48.580
Example means a person or action that others copy.

33
00:01:49.183 --> 00:01:51.044
My brother sets a good example.

34
00:01:51.650 --> 00:01:53.989
Your turn. Say: Example.

35
00:01:56.833 --> 00:01:57.951
Example.

36
00:01:58.717 --> 00:01:59.729
Values.

37
00:02:00.717 --> 00:02:03.889
Values means the beliefs about what is right and important.

38
00:02:04.483 --> 00:02:06.866
Honesty is one of my family's values.

39
00:02:07.450 --> 00:02:10.068
Your turn. Say: Values.

40
00:02:12.933 --> 00:02:14.016
Values.

41
00:02:14.750 --> 00:02:15.472
Respect.

42
00:02:16.483 --> 00:02:19.505
Respect means a feeling that someone is good and important.

43
00:02:20.117 --> 00:02:22.151
He earned the respect of everyone.

44
00:02:22.750 --> 00:02:25.495
Your turn. Say: Respect.

45
00:02:28.333 --> 00:02:29.369
Respect.

46
00:02:30.167 --> 00:02:34.061
Part two: dialogue. Let's listen to a conversation.

47
00:02:34.917 --> 00:02:36.812
Visal, who is your role model?

48
00:02:37.917 --> 00:02:42.427
My uncle. He's a doctor who helps poor families for free.

49
00:02:43.517 --> 00:02:44.854
Why do you admire him?

50
00:02:45.950 --> 00:02:49.891
He's a person who never gives up. He studied at night while he worked.

51
00:02:50.983 --> 00:02:52.344
That's inspiring!

52
00:02:53.450 --> 00:02:57.623
Yes. He sets an example for everyone who knows him.

53
00:02:58.767 --> 00:03:00.813
Part three: grammar.

54
00:03:01.650 --> 00:03:04.033
Grammar focus: Relative clauses with who.

55
00:03:04.333 --> 00:03:05.531
Look at the pattern.

56
00:03:06.217 --> 00:03:08.982
A role model is someone who inspires others.

57
00:03:09.883 --> 00:03:12.231
I admire people who set a good example.

58
00:03:13.117 --> 00:03:15.221
She is a singer who helps children.

59
00:03:16.167 --> 00:03:21.104
'Someone' and 'a person' are singular, so the verb after 'who' takes -s: someone who inspires.

60
00:03:21.850 --> 00:03:26.139
Be careful! Don't say: A role model is someone who inspire others.

61
00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:31.423
Say: A role model is someone who inspires others.

62
00:03:31.723 --> 00:03:34.500
'Someone' is singular, so add -s to the verb.

63
00:03:35.300 --> 00:03:38.161
Part four: reading. Read and listen.

64
00:03:38.967 --> 00:03:40.339
People I Admire.

65
00:03:40.639 --> 00:03:44.845
A role model is someone who inspires you through their achievements and values.

66
00:03:45.833 --> 00:03:49.296
My role model is my grandmother, who raised six children alone.

67
00:03:50.300 --> 00:03:54.598
I admire people who set a good example and positively influence others.

68
00:03:55.600 --> 00:03:59.271
My grandmother is a person who never complains and always helps.

69
00:04:00.267 --> 00:04:03.683
Her kind actions earn real respect from our whole village.

70
00:04:04.767 --> 00:04:08.571
Part five: quiz. Three questions. Are you ready?

71
00:04:09.417 --> 00:04:12.229
A role model is someone blank inspires others.

72
00:04:12.529 --> 00:04:15.579
A, who. B, which. C, where.

73
00:04:19.133 --> 00:04:20.715
The answer is A: who.

74
00:04:21.850 --> 00:04:24.639
To respect and like someone very much is to blank.

75
00:04:24.939 --> 00:04:28.616
A, admire. B, influence. C, inspire.

76
00:04:32.167 --> 00:04:34.120
The answer is A: admire.

77
00:04:35.283 --> 00:04:37.678
Beliefs about what is right and important are blank.

78
00:04:37.978 --> 00:04:41.817
A, values. B, examples. C, achievements.

79
00:04:45.367 --> 00:04:47.308
The answer is A: values.

80
00:04:48.500 --> 00:04:51.559
Part six: speaking. It's your turn to talk.

81
00:04:52.417 --> 00:04:55.206
Who is your role model, and why do you admire them?

82
00:05:04.017 --> 00:05:05.494
Now listen to Visal.

83
00:05:05.794 --> 00:05:14.402
My role model is my mother. She is a person who works hard every day, and she always helps people who need it.

84
00:05:14.702 --> 00:05:16.748
Excellent answer, Visal!

85
00:05:17.650 --> 00:05:22.044
Great work! Now you can use eight new words and relative clauses with who.

86
00:05:22.344 --> 00:05:26.889
Today's value is inspiration. Learn from great people and follow your dreams.

87
00:05:27.189 --> 00:05:29.702
See you in Unit nineteen. Goodbye!

88
00:05:30.002 --> 00:05:32.770
Thank you, Ms. Emma! Bye, everyone!

